0	NULL	note	Coptic SCRIPTORIUM\'s edition includes only Giron\'s transcription of the manuscript. It is not a diplomatic transcription based on reading and collation of the original manuscript. Giron titled this document &quot;Sacrifice of Abraham,&quot; but it is now known to be one of the fragments of the Coptic Life/Lives  of John Chrysostom. Chapter divisions follow paragraph divisions in Giron\'s French translation. Giron reversed the recto and verso of folio 2 in his transcription. Orlandi 1977 labels this document as Fragment 4. Hence our page and chapter ids reflect this classification.
